&#8220;I’m so grateful for the opportunity to do this,&#8221; Siwa continued. &#8220;What a dream. Moments like this remind me why I love what I do and how important it is to keep showing up, keep learning, and to just keep going.&#8221;

&#8220;Thank you to everyone who made this possible,&#8221; she added. &#8220;To say I spoke at Harvard might be the coolest thing I’ve ever done. I don’t know if it can get much better than this.&#8221;

Belli Welli also shared a video of JoJo sitting in the Harvard classroom and writing on the chalkboard.

The Ivy League visit comes after a health scare Siwa experienced toward the end of 2025. Ahead of a scheduled concert in Minnesota, the Dance Moms alum had a cyst rupture in her stomach, forcing her to go to the hospital.

She appears to be feeling much better now, though. Prior to her Harvard side quest, she shared photos of herself and her boyfriend, Big Brother costar Chris Hughes, cozying up on a trip to Palm Springs. She last dropped music in November, releasing &#8220;Message to the World (Little Drummer Girl)&#8221; &#8212; which followed October&#8217;s &#8220;Waste of a Heartbreak.&#8221;

